      "adaptation": "Editor/sidebar backgrounds, keyword commands, punctuation/operator delimiters, numeric constants, and comments; missing punctuation uses text. Accent uses links (Night Owl uses keyword). All RGB colors are opaque; upstream alpha is removed, not applied to text. Native glass and artwork rendering are unchanged."
